anti_cheese = "Single-letter ranks are ambiguous in a letter this size, so a rank-order guess misreads it. The crib strip compares letters only (no spaces), so the player must slide it to where its letter-repeat pattern is self-consistent; 'agrees' means consistent, not proven. Pinning applies about eleven letters at once. The preview never places letters by itself. After a frenzy only IN ETERNITY survives the blood: it still fits in one place but pins six letters instead of eleven."
